    "license": "CC0-1.0 (intended)",
    "notes": "Cyclops Cove 4 (Subtronics x Bassrush), Fri Dec 4 - Sun Dec 6 2026, Sunset Cove Amphitheater, 20405 Amphitheater Circle, Boca Raton FL 33498 (Burt Aaronson South County Regional Park); 18+; no camping offered (hotel/lodging only) despite the festival's 'cove' branding. Doors 2 PM Fri/Sat (curfew 11 PM) and 1 PM Sun (curfew 10 PM) per the Front Gate ticketing page. Venue lat/lon is the US Census Bureau geocoder's address-interpolated point for 20405 Amphitheater Cir — approximate, not a surveyed stage position. Lineup announced 2026-04-21/23; per-day split (Dec 4 / 5 / 6) taken from JamBase and Festival Dust, which agree on every entry except Subtronics' Dec 5 solo set (listed by JamBase, omitted by Festival Dust) — kept because official coverage (EDM Identity, EDM.com, Exron) states two solo sets plus the b2b with Crankdat. STAGES: 2026 stage names are not yet announced; 'Cyclops Stage' and 'Takeover Stage' are the 2024 (Cyclops Cove 3) stage names carried forward as placeholders. 2026 label takeovers (Cyclops Recordings, Bassrush Records, MorFlo Records — one per day) are announced but not tied to a named stage or a day, so every schedule entry has stage: null. Set times are not published; all start/end are null. Set times for previous editions dropped via Subtronics' Instagram/Facebook roughly one week before the event (CC3's were posted ~2024-12-01), so expect late November 2026."
